sequenceDiagram
    actor User as "Admin/Sales Manager/Sales"
    participant UI as "Interface: UI"
    participant API as "mainController: Controller"
    participant Service as "reportService: Service"
    participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
    User->>UI: Select period and dashboard filters
    UI->>+API: GET /api/v1/reports/sales-kpis
    API->>+Service: authorizeAndBuildKpiQuery(scope, period)
    Service->>+DB: Read scoped delivered orders and configuration version
    Service->>+DB: Aggregate adjusted revenue, order counts and targets
    DB-->>-Service: KPI source records
    Service-->>-API: KPI summary and drill-down order IDs
    API-->>-UI: Render dashboard
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/reports/best-selling-products
    API->>Service: rankDeliveredProducts(scope, period)
    Service->>DB: Aggregate carton quantity and adjusted revenue
    Service-->>UI: Best-selling ranking
    Note over Service,DB: Revenue uses historical promotion HSD discount and approved adjustment snapshots


